{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41391","headline":"早朝 · 冯延巳","name":"早朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜壶滴漏初昼，高阁鸡鸣半空。\n催啓五门金锁，犹垂三殿帘栊。\n阶前御柳摇绿，仗下宫花散红。\n鸳瓦数行晓日，鸾旗百尺春风。\n侍臣踏舞重拜，圣寿南山永同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}